  "previous_batch_bytes_unchanged": true,
  "manifest_sha256": "715bbabf6c1406a2a0772bc7dea74ab0e7b05c4919e1db206dd7e720081f865f",
  "files": [
    {
      "speaker": "elna",
      "text": "Leave a place by the door for anyone who cannot sleep among strangers yet. They are still staying with us.",
      "path": "res://assets_external/audio/voices/community/f9c7e9ccc88edb7523434954a3f4d2e2fdb7c30d6f5eabf4ee9764d84d19c274.ogg",
      "sha256": "e695605fecf00736c5838147d345a8321fdb6448aa72c52016365b4fc82e0bce",
      "bytes": 51406,
      "duration_seconds": 7.262666666666667
    },
    {
      "speaker": "toma",
      "text": "The next meal will use what we kept dry today. That is a small promise, but it is one I can check with my own hands.",
      "path": "res://assets_external/audio/voices/community/5fc2db3e7a010fdf0b5b701f181729054e55ec672f5442e20076cb48b3b22be2.ogg",
      "sha256": "cc14020f7ffa28d10ae17d7ad6f9e8373733b34fc63331263210b6ebe2a4b8c3",
      "bytes": 44466,
      "duration_seconds": 7.002
    },
    {
      "speaker": "edric",
      "text": "I can account for the authority I used. I cannot lend you the consent of anyone who once answered to it. Put my answer beside the others, not above them.",
      "path": "res://assets_external/audio/voices/community/79b2150472da483162c97782a5fbaa9db02560ec36208cfc8471179139255fbe.ogg",
      "sha256": "447f4556b306ec8e79baecd0fc72b208d96880607a671aab02cdd6feceb7ad49",
      "bytes": 61475,
      "duration_seconds": 9.747333333333334
    },
    {
      "speaker": "senn",
      "text": "That bell is a warning, not a muster. If I answer it, I will come because I chose a watch. Keep my old rank off the board.",
      "path": "res://assets_external/audio/voices/community/f321ac19b022861a4961a1686e5b33d88a1da6f71efcd4573a32875d31feb83e.ogg",
      "sha256": "04355ccfb15b09437eb21c75504f052741d2f2f2e86c0b52564901a3d72b7272",
      "bytes": 60539,
      "duration_seconds": 8.353333333333333
    },
    {
      "speaker": "anwen",
      "text": "The rota shows what is covered and what is vacant. We ask before we put a name in either place.",
      "path": "res://assets_external/audio/voices/community/ab7ea5fcedea181e1fa813de25d7eadfa6588e9dbe83088228556aa3bc3f1c5a.ogg",
      "sha256": "2e97cb1de18c9909c01e0eaf4663fc3baffcc8cbe1e1c4682f2425802a4f8499",
      "bytes": 40583,
      "duration_seconds": 5.469333333333333
    },
    {
      "speaker": "quality_mourner",
      "text": "The rota shows what is covered and what is vacant. We ask before we put a name in either place.",
      "path": "res://assets_external/audio/voices/community/535c11d4ec8c02f4c0f46475f1fdeef597002470ac10fff1e626ef34c4834ecd.ogg",
      "sha256": "42a2bfd7ac3103ef302852181227fd90a8dd04dad7308722b7a94a6c1f8c454d",
      "bytes": 47831,
      "duration_seconds": 6.601333333333334
    },
    {
      "speaker": "anwen",
      "text": "The households reached Hearthward. There's no ward there, or here now. We have the copies; the rest of the Hart's memory is gone.",
      "path": "res://assets_external/audio/voices/community/55187b36ca7459638187773fbeaa04365c95f459d614f16c99ed2db3d1fa3c84.ogg",
      "sha256": "fd6f2ea3858873812ea8b1d193394e9829e09865ea7ed5512a76b64dd2f6b6a6",
      "bytes": 48862,
      "duration_seconds": 6.98
    },
    {
      "speaker": "quality_mourner",
      "text": "The households reached Hearthward. There's no ward there, or here now. We have the copies; the rest of the Hart's memory is gone.",
      "path": "res://assets_external/audio/voices/community/47b224287b2285195774e82763942e2e8a31eefef8d9a570b8c752e79492f1cf.ogg",
      "sha256": "87ff1f4535cd79f675a370362ca8acd666df914df36da13365579f8cbd4c1adf",
      "bytes": 56240,
      "duration_seconds": 8.120666666666667
    },
    {
      "speaker": "anwen",
      "text": "I can take the dawn round. If I cannot keep it, I will tell the next keeper. That is what I am offering.",
      "path": "res://assets_external/audio/voices/community/287aa796f56de1543c1419c38e84791edd04e29eb78568da23ee5b51a1f4d9fa.ogg",
      "sha256": "45501fa7442cb0e0e8326aeada41e5e89e3c96d409cd4df16c4250df25270059",
      "bytes": 45019,
      "duration_seconds": 6.196
    },
    {
      "speaker": "anwen",
      "text": "Not another promise today. The beds are still open; my answer need not close them.",
      "path": "res://assets_external/audio/voices/community/9bf68ff99d0b8195ec8695f7e1eafbcfd0518863c3d663ea1c892f502793f436.ogg",
      "sha256": "f2357266bc2b662168a78ead91134544109bf4bc7ad67710ab91b0ffc9041db2",
      "bytes": 36342,
      "duration_seconds": 4.947333333333333
    },
    {
      "speaker": "anwen",
      "text": "I need to leave the dawn round. Put my place back on the board, without putting another name in it.",
      "path": "res://assets_external/audio/voices/community/2f68b3889ecabbf3ea95e2f3627ceffda6a910c6549e8266ba07cfcfa54864be.ogg",
      "sha256": "aacb67c3ca99cba0b3037473e9b085d7d970ab41d77dfd4cb4782fe22eeedf6f",
      "bytes": 37906,
      "duration_seconds": 5.208
    },
    {
      "speaker": "kael",
      "text": "Will you take a care shift, with the right to step away?",
      "path": "res://assets_external/audio/voices/community/a3c80c9e5ef46215279198f22fb7d3c9c063a42573e52599b80cffcaeb807fdf.ogg",
      "sha256": "2d0957470dbf98abebb0c272bff36b23fcd4158f21d374ad8327aa97ec589388",
      "bytes": 23530,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9832916666666667
    },
    {
      "speaker": "mira",
      "text": "I will take the evening round, and teach someone willing to cover it. No one learns by being volunteered.",
      "path": "res://assets_external/audio/voices/community/583c79f9d39c4122f2b456c7bf839bf1ba8e75cdec3a4d30cd2457b56c4f2ac5.ogg",
      "sha256": "3f571d98801a5406264563ffd07099a3f74e9a6e4eb4a9e770e7d0e8857a401b",
      "bytes": 44665,
      "duration_seconds": 6.350666666666666
    },
    {
      "speaker": "mira",
      "text": "I can help with this room. I cannot promise a standing shift.",
      "path": "res://assets_external/audio/voices/community/9b0a622f19fb41508c9a14ff4c2c2c3c5d89c5c67bb1edf57c8fbb99906c2543.ogg",
      "sha256": "fbc99cdc3794082cf445f7b92e7ed2eab615949b3017d0ce22885a8811787ef1",
      "bytes": 27037,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5646666666666667
    },
    {
      "speaker": "mira",
      "text": "I cannot carry the evening round now. The medicines and instructions stay here.",
      "path": "res://assets_external/audio/voices/community/4cf77dd61b098f7aabaa5eb539088c7f6e0c2a56e71adba2f9f1fd8719a31d95.ogg",
      "sha256": "f8f79a701e632ceba7f3b595531a1b1749ea0aafe56d8050c5b05e4df7b0ce50",
      "bytes": 33791,
      "duration_seconds": 4.524666666666667
    },
    {
      "speaker": "kael",
      "text": "Would you choose to share the care work?",
      "path": "res://assets_external/audio/voices/community/dd1e92bed380267a29060b8645ff05d163a628da0a9d3535c44af88a359521bc.ogg",
      "sha256": "fbb43886c763c61ef211c8fae0073aed4999fd31353cf540a8ea75d94ad38b90",
      "bytes": 16189,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9306666666666668
    },
    {
      "speaker": "nera",
      "text": "One crossing round in the morning. Weather can stop it, and I can leave it. Write both beside my name.",
      "path": "res://assets_external/audio/voices/community/d87f64a5e1a65bffb71a70ccb0240ccf706636835989d13620d0752f13644cf7.ogg",
      "sha256": "03e50d7d77a3930da8bd93bd638f67843389913e191d7109ebd40c86631caccf",
      "bytes": 42727,
      "duration_seconds": 6.121291666666667
    },
    {
      "speaker": "nera",
      "text": "I can explain the route. I am not agreeing to keep it every day.",
      "path": "res://assets_external/audio/voices/community/88373f4913674b67eb6aba49669366217dced5e7b803a575b557a5d41a5ffbd7.ogg",
      "sha256": "cf32a547892f15e21d43d6514280b40cac1d30b88bdd1b744135a244bc788f4b",
      "bytes": 29187,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93
    },
    {
      "speaker": "nera",
      "text": "Take me off the crossing rota. Leave the route marks for whoever comes next.",
      "path": "res://assets_external/audio/voices/community/b24084b12b4a9055ff9118d74c8e844e24440257ebe3fe8c5c84702896a85f5a.ogg",
      "sha256": "1b02fb953a88515e50e5bbb9f1b430aa0d42ed753c98481e36a3b8a96c705ceb",
      "bytes": 34083,
      "duration_seconds": 4.693333333333333
    },
    {
      "speaker": "kael",
      "text": "Will you keep a route shift under these terms?",
      "path": "res://assets_external/audio/voices/community/2248a4fbff88e51a710b1128867ec8b220647088d200a1085f9dd3784d2eadec.ogg",
      "sha256": "25cb4b5303bcff26b6232d6dad851f8e463e46a47356cc777a3668d776820ce7",
      "bytes": 18545,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3032916666666665
    },
    {
      "speaker": "nessa",
      "text": "I will keep the kitchen's count for now. If I stop, the bowls do not stop with me.",
      "path": "res://assets_external/audio/voices/community/74449526afdad30e7f93ee503eb7a56eb7eaa778b7ecfaa99225369da464dd4b.ogg",
      "sha256": "9f7baca1f055d5f54c62ef29a67da134a13cb6e7e41ed3bd7034a866b8528229",
      "bytes": 33444,
      "duration_seconds": 4.454
    },
    {
      "speaker": "nessa",
      "text": "I have already promised today's meal. That is all I can give you now.",
      "path": "res://assets_external/audio/voices/community/c9b03b92d0bc188521f65b91747abda7264c1da5adaf2f95857b9292b05d5ec8.ogg",
      "sha256": "efe42e007d8b2a9e0670fd51e9a8e96220339cba184ed5dccdf707a26cb37b78",
      "bytes": 28192,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7653333333333334
    },
    {
      "speaker": "nessa",
      "text": "Someone else must keep the count after today. Nobody loses their share because I am tired.",
      "path": "res://assets_external/audio/voices/community/26c1f587f450eabeb9a4b268578a7686d4bbae3d51307a728446b94b9a8f18d0.ogg",
      "sha256": "2eff4032a5f09fe11d1ab2de9404a647b8011f44f769d6b09c25bcb8d5cbb35a",
      "bytes": 39198,
      "duration_seconds": 5.2472916666666665
    },
    {
      "speaker": "kael",
      "text": "Would you take a share of the food and delivery rota?",
      "path": "res://assets_external/audio/voices/community/0f65bb45d0971c24d78115c27746e4ff169ccbdc9dfc26280a4c614a55ca625d.ogg",
      "sha256": "2cd2b62db8c718babf9695bbf18ba8c77ade6baade9e3528253e5a23ca78e9de",
      "bytes": 22891,
      "duration_seconds": 2.804
    },
    {
      "speaker": "vale",
      "text": "I will check one public copy and protect what was entrusted to me. A record is evidence. It is never somebody's consent.",
      "path": "res://assets_external/audio/voices/community/82f2735b613d87e1b7d730a912d4ffb7642fc62c376e91c0d0c2e79349eddacc.ogg",
      "sha256": "f2fc502c776b00a22693f98fce8e0c2fb092f47d35474b6ae6c18cf68bcb2862",
      "bytes": 52356,
      "duration_seconds": 7.3693333333333335
    }
  ],
